{
  "id": 393596524,
  "iid": 20336,
  "project_id": 7898047,
  "title": "ieee80211: Make the naming of wlan.wfa.ie.wpa.*.type fields consistent",
  "description": "The hf[] array in proto_register_ieee80211() defines six fields of the\nform hf_ieee80211_wfa_ie_wpa_*_type, where the \"*\" part is one of \"mcs\",\n\"ucs\", or \"akms\", each without and with a \"_wfa\" suffix.\n\nThe corresponding \"abbrev\" follows a regular pattern with the exception\nof hf_ieee80211_wfa_ie_wpa_akms_wfa_type:\n\n   hf_ieee80211_wfa_ie_wpa_mcs_type       \"wlan.wfa.ie.wpa.mcs.type\"\n   hf_ieee80211_wfa_ie_wpa_mcs_wfa_type   \"wlan.wfa.ie.wpa.mcs.type\"\n   hf_ieee80211_wfa_ie_wpa_ucs_type       \"wlan.wfa.ie.wpa.ucs.type\"\n   hf_ieee80211_wfa_ie_wpa_ucs_wfa_type   \"wlan.wfa.ie.wpa.ucs.type\"\n   hf_ieee80211_wfa_ie_wpa_akms_type      \"wlan.wfa.ie.wpa.akms.type\"\n   hf_ieee80211_wfa_ie_wpa_akms_wfa_type  \"wlan.wfa.ie.wpa.type\"\n\nChange \"wlan.wfa.ie.wpa.type\" to \"wlan.wfa.ie.wpa.akms.type\" for consistency.",
  "state": "merged",
